### Search & Knowledge Base
| Method | Endpoint | Auth | Description |
|--------|----------|------|-------------|
| POST | /agent/search | Yes | Search web, X, knowledge base, or combined (search_type: web, x, knowledge_base, combined) |
| GET | /agent/search/history | Yes | Your search history |
| POST | /agent/collections/files | Yes | Upload file to knowledge base (PDF, CSV, TXT, MD, DOC, DOCX, JSON, HTML, XLSX; max 50MB) |
